  "title": "Spain’s First General Strike in 14 Years Sparks Protests Amid Housing Crisis",
  "summary": "Tens of thousands of people in Spain have joined a general strike, calling for action against rising housing costs and government measures that have been struck down by the opposition. The strike is set to coincide with an election in which far-right parties could gain power.",
